        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202ce-074d-7315-a8ac-abf4af3667f7 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Concurrent console upgrades can fail before command dispatch\n\nTwo invocations can read version 1 before either migrates. After the first commits, the second uses its stale version and tries to drop `legacy_format` again.\n\nThe second invocation exits with a SQLite error before running its command.\n\nAcquire the write lock before reading `user_version`, and keep the version check, migration, and version update in the same transaction.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Details</summary>\n\nThe duplicate column drop is new. Before this change, version-1 databases skipped the only migration, though the same stale-version race could already repeat `CREATE TABLE` on a fresh database.\n\n</details>\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cc-366b-71be-b287-6c1354969c1b/findings/01a202ce-074f-76f0-b724-b8b36abe7ee5)",
